  "goodToKnow": "Verharmlosen means to play down or trivialise: eine Gefahr, Gewalt, Drogen verharmlosen. Denying or trivialising the Holocaust (verharmlosen) is a criminal offence in Germany under §130 StGB. A colloquial synonym is herunterspielen. The opposite is dramatisieren or übertreiben. From harmlos (harmless). Not separable: hat verharmlost."
